  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: Promoting Gender Equality and Social Inclusion Through Community Budgeting</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to promote gender equality and social inclusion in Armenia by ensuring that community budgets fairly address the needs of all groups, especially women, girls, and the Yezidi community. This will be done by both building the capacities of LSGs in the project target regions, increasing the participation of marginalized groups in decision-making, and supporting civil society to advocate for fairer and more inclusive budget policies.</narrative>
  </description>
